# Intentionally empty.
#
# This project must build with its own directory as the build context, so
# that Vercel resolves THIS file rather than the repository root's
# .vercelignore — which ignores /api/ to keep the shop deploy under the
# Hobby serverless-function cap, and would otherwise strip this project's
# own package.json before `npm install` runs.
#
# Requires "Include source files outside of the Root Directory in the Build
# Step" to be OFF for the homevibe-api project. See docs/SPLIT_ARCHITECTURE.md.
